[ PANDORAKIT H BOOTSTRAP - hydrogen run for any custom atmosphere ]
[ 3-level H from scratch. POPUP updates NE + H populations. ]
[ Works with any depth count N - contains no depth-indexed statements. ]
KK ( 9 ) >
NVH ( 0 ) >
USE ( MODEL ) >
USE ( ATOM ) >
DO ( LYMAN ) >
OMIT ( PHASE2 ) >
GO >
USE ( MODEL ) >
USE ( ATOM ) >
USE ( RESTART ) >
IOMX ( 5 ) >
POPUP ( HYDROGEN ) >
XK ( 1. 1.1 1.2 1.4 1.7 2.3 3. 5. 8. ) >
GO >
GO >
USE ( MODEL ) >
GO
